+- Transferring a user (`/orgs/{orgID}/users/{uid}/transfer`) is an org admin
+  operation on the organization the user is in now. A caller from another
+  organization, or a `{orgID}` that is not the caller's, → 404. A caller in
+  the organization who is not an org admin → 403. A user missing or not in
+  `{orgID}` → 404.
